---
// Creative Development & Talent Incubation Section
---
<section class="py-20 bg-[var(--color-canvas)] border-b border-[var(--color-border-subtle)]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-accent-amber)] mb-2">
        Capacity Building & Industry Pathways
      </h2>
      <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
        Beyond Screenings: Nurturing Rwanda's Creative Leaders
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        MUSANABANDI builds sustainable creative careers by equipping persons with disabilities to become certified directors, screenwriters, sound designers, and producers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] space-y-3">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-accent-amber)]">01</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Adaptive Filmmaking Labs</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          Masterclasses utilizing tactile focus gear, voice-assisted editing software, and wheelchair-accessible camera stabilization rigs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] space-y-3">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-accent-amber)]">02</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Screenwriting & Story Incubators</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          Mentorship pairing emerging Rwandan disabled writers with seasoned international script doctors to craft broadcast-ready screenplays.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] space-y-3">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-accent-amber)]">03</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Industry Apprenticeships</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          Connecting graduates directly with Rwandan broadcast stations, commercial studios, and international film co-productions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
